This file maps each file available in the Debian GNU/Linux system to
the package from which it originates.  It includes packages from the
DIST distribution for the ARCH architecture.

You can use this list to determine which package contains a specific
file, or whether or not to install a package to obtain a particular
file.

Files are listed with their full path, relative to the root of the
filesystem, and the packages providing them are listed with their
section.

FILE                                                    LOCATION
bin/bash                                                shells/bash
usr/bin/dpkg                                            admin/dpkg
usr/share/doc/README.Debian                             admin/dpkg,admin/dpkg-dev
